# The Clockmaster (jeuno 21): the door _6s2 and Collet in Upper Jeuno. The guard (Save the Clock Tower completed,
# Jeuno fame level 5), the door's 152 (a full bag: not completed; with room: completed, Time Hammer, 1200 gil,
# Timekeeper, fame +17 x3), then the door's 110 and Collet's 163 (both replaceDefault).
# A Clock Most Delicate is set completed (it answers the door at fame level 2 otherwise). Jeuno fame: 216/217/216 is
# 324 (level 4), 216/217/217 is 325 (level 5). Collet's default 114, the door's NO_ONES_HOME.
lists UpperJeuno/_6s2/onTrigger UpperJeuno/Collet/onTrigger UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/152
char zone=UpperJeuno pos=-80.1,-2.7,107.5
fame Sandoria 216
fame Bastok 217
fame Windurst 216
quest Jeuno.AClockMostDelicate completed
item BoneChip
login
trigger _6s2                                # Save the Clock Tower available: no section; NO_ONES_HOME
quest Jeuno.SaveTheClockTower completed     # a GM
trigger _6s2                                # Jeuno fame 324: no section; NO_ONES_HOME
fame Windurst 217                           # 325: level 5
trade _6s2 BoneChip x1                      # available: no trade handler; nothing
trigger _6s2                                # available: 152
fill-inventory
finish                                      # no room for the hammer: not completed
free-inventory
walk -42.2,0,107
trigger Collet                              # available: no handler; 114
finish
trade Collet BoneChip x1                    # available: no trade handler; nothing
walk -80.1,-2.7,107.5
trigger _6s2                                # 152 again
finish                                      # completed: Time Hammer, 1200 gil, Timekeeper, fame +17 x3
trigger _6s2                                # completed: 110 (replaceDefault)
finish
walk -42.2,0,107
trigger Collet                              # completed: 163 (replaceDefault)
finish
